### README.md  [docs]
+ # Douyin Search
+ > Search Douyin by natural language, with browser automation and web search fallback.
+ ## What it does
+ - Search Douyin with natural language queries ("搜索一下海鲜视频")
+ - Access 抖音热榜 (hot trends) reliably
+ - Extract video titles, authors, stats, and links when possible
+ - Falls back to web search when direct access is blocked
+ ## Limitations
+ - Direct search may be blocked by captcha outside mainland China
+ - Best results from mainland China IP or authenticated sessions
+ - Hot trends always work; keyword search depends on environment
+ ## Prerequisites
+ - `agent-browser` CLI installed

